<div class="container">
  <h1>${$global.title}</h1>
  <div class="content" no-parse>
    <h1 id="about-markopress" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#about-markopress">#</a> About MarkoPress</h1>
<p>MarkoPress is a general-purpose static site generator built on top of Marko.js v6, designed to be compatible with VitePress and Docusaurus content.</p>
<h2 id="why-markopress%3F" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#why-markopress%3F">#</a> Why MarkoPress?</h2>
<ul>
<li>Uses the powerful Marko.js templating engine</li>
<li>Full TypeScript support</li>
<li>Plugin-based architecture</li>
<li>Fast development with Vite</li>
<li>Static site generation for optimal performance</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="architecture" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#architecture">#</a> Architecture</h2>
<p>Built on top of @marko/run with:</p>
<ul>
<li>Markdown processing via gray-matter and markdown-it</li>
<li>File-based routing</li>
<li>Plugin system with lifecycle hooks</li>
<li>Theme system with slot-based overrides</li>
</ul>

  </div>
</div>
